    "description": "This dataset comprises of bacterial taxonomy profiling data derived from the subplots of the B11 experiment. The samples were taken in April/May 2017. The tables show all detected taxonomic Units based on 16S rRNA (v3-v4) sequencing data. The rawdata was cleaned and mapped against the SILVA database for taxonomic classification.",
